Subject: libcamera: enable software ISP for mtk-seninf

MT8183's ISP Pass 1 writes Bayer data to memory but performs no
demosaicing or colour conversion, and the mtk-mdp converter cannot
consume its output formats. Enable libcamera's software ISP so the
simple pipeline handler produces a usable stream.

Applied as a prepare() step in the pmaports temp/libcamera APKBUILD,
following the same approach as the existing PinePhone patch.

--- a/APKBUILD
+++ b/APKBUILD
@@
 builddir="$srcdir/$pkgname-v$_pkgver"
+
+prepare() {
+	default_prepare
+
+	sed -i 's|{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, false },|{ "mtk-seninf", {}, true },|' \
+		src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+	grep -q '{ "mtk-seninf", {}, true },' src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+}
